sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Discord
  participant Bot as Streamkist
  participant DB as Database
  User->>Discord: Run tracking command
  Discord->>Bot: Slash command or component interaction
  Bot->>Bot: Check permissions and parse control
  Bot->>DB: Read or update tracking configuration
  DB-->>Bot: Current or updated state
  Bot-->>Discord: Respond with controls or status card
  Discord-->>User: Interaction response
